- App 供应商订单：`store-app/h5/supplier-orders.html`
- App 供应商结算：`store-app/h5/supplier-settle.html`
- PC 订单供应商视角 / 结算：`MDM/mdm_order_*.html`、`MDM/mdm_settle_index.html`
